<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>Remove a Card - Trading Card Collection Tracker</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Instructions for removing a trading card">
    <meta name="author" content="Kevin Bennett">
    <link href="https://stackpath.bootstrapcdn.com/bootstrap/4.2.1/css/bootstrap.min.css"
          rel="stylesheet">
</head>

<body>
    <nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg navbar-dark bg-dark">
        <a class="navbar-brand" href="/">Trading Card Tracker</a>

        <ul class="navbar-nav">
            <li class="nav-item">
                <a class="nav-link" href="/">Home</a>
            </li>
            <li class="nav-item">
                <a class="nav-link" href="/documentation">Documentation</a>
            </li>
            <li class="nav-item">
                <a class="nav-link" href="/quickstart">Quickstart</a>
            </li>
        </ul>
    </nav>

    <main class="container mt-4 mb-5">
        <h1>Remove a Card</h1>

        <ol>
            <li>Select a card from the table on the main window.</li>
            <li>Click <strong>Remove Card</strong>.</li>
            <li>Review the confirmation message.</li>
            <li>Click <strong>OK</strong> to remove the card, or click <strong>Cancel</strong> to keep it.</li>
        </ol>

        <h2 class="h4 mt-4">Confirm the Removal</h2>
        <img src="/images/remove-card-confirmation.png"
             class="img-fluid border"
             alt="Confirmation message for removing a card">

        <h2 class="h4 mt-4">Collection After Removal</h2>
        <img src="/images/remove-card-result.png"
             class="img-fluid border"
             alt="Collection after the card has been removed">
    </main>
</body>
</html>